Chat Package

Standalone chat UI package for FDE Desktop with message list, input, and typing indicators.
Overview
@fde-desktop/chat is a separate package that provides reusable chat components. It’s designed to be consumed by any app that needs chat functionality.
Package Structure
packages/chat/
├── src/
│   ├── ChatWindow.tsx           # Main chat window component
