Components
ChatWindow
Main container component:
import { ChatWindow } from &#039;@fde-desktop/chat&#039;;

&lt;ChatWindow
  messages={messages}
  onSendMessage={handleSend}
  typingUsers={[&#039;Alice&#039;, &#039;Bob&#039;]}
  showTypingIndicator={true}
/&gt;
ChatInput
Rich input with attachment support:
&lt;ChatInput
  onSend={handleSend}
  onAttach={handleAttach}
  placeholder=&quot;Type a message...&quot;
  disabled={false}
/&gt;
MessageItem
Individual message rendering:
&lt;MessageItem
  message={message}
  isOwn={message.sender === currentUser}
  showAvatar={true}
/&gt;
TypingIndicator
Animated typing indicator:
