how-to-create-app — App registration patterns

entities/apps/welcome-app.content:
Welcome App

Personal portfolio application for FDE Desktop. Showcases developer skills, experience, and projects.
Overview
The Welcome App is a custom app that displays a personal portfolio with:

Hero section with animated introduction
Skills bar with technology tags
Experience timeline with depth control
Animated Unicode decorations

Features

HeroSection — Animated introduction with name and title
SkillsBar — Interactive skills display with technology categories
TechTags — Filterable technology tags
ExperienceDepthSelect — Control timeline detail level
UnicodeAnimation — Decorative braille animations

Components
src/Presentation/Components/Apps/WelcomeApp/
├── WelcomeApp.tsx              # Main app component
├── WelcomeApp.module.css       # Styles
├── WelcomeApp.test.tsx         # Unit tests
