HeroSection
import { HeroSection } from &#039;./components/HeroSection&#039;;

&lt;HeroSection
  name=&quot;Francisco Núñez&quot;
  title=&quot;Full Stack Developer&quot;
  subtitle=&quot;Creating digital experiences&quot;
/&gt;
Uses useUnicodeAnimation for animated decorations:
const spinner = useUnicodeAnimationElement(&#039;pulse&#039;, {
  className: classes.spinner
});
SkillsBar
Displays skill categories with interactive selection:
&lt;SkillsBar
  skills={profileData.skills}
  selectedCategory={selectedCategory}
  onSelectCategory={setSelectedCategory}
/&gt;
TechTags
Filterable technology tags:
&lt;TechTags
  technologies={technologies}
