Unicode Animations
The app uses the useUnicodeAnimation hook for braille-style animated decorations:
import { useUnicodeAnimationElement } from &#039;@fde-desktop/fde-core&#039;;

const spinner = useUnicodeAnimationElement(&#039;pulse&#039;, {
