entities/desktop-icon.content:
Desktop Icon
Draggable icon on the desktop. Supports double-click to open, right-click for context menu.
Entity
interface DesktopIconEntity {
  id: string;
  appId?: string;  // Link to app
  x: number;
  y: number;
  icon: string;
  fcIcon?: string;
  name: string;
  url?: string;  // For files
}
Behavior

Double-click opens app or file
Drag to reposition
Right-click shows context menu
Multi-select with Shift/Ctrl

Implementation Notes

CRITICAL: The icon container MUST have position: absolute for left/top inline styles to work. Using position: relative will cause icons to stack at (0,0).

CSS Modules class uses composes pattern:
.iconContainer {
  composes: flexColumnCenter absolute pointer noSelect;
}
The absolute keyword is essential — left and top props from x/y entity values require absolute positioning.
